                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "An ok adventure game.\nI liked the concept but the gameplay was lacking. It's basically running back and forth to remove blochages with a new spell you've obtained. \nThe map wasn't too big but it still would have been helpful if you would've been able to zoom out of the in-game map.\nThere were also only two \"real\" puzzles and they weren't hard.\n\nI also had some problems with motion sickness, probably because the background scrolled in a strange way. Though I likes the minimal style of the game.\nOtherwise it's relaxing, I guess.\n\nHad no problem to continue after finishing the game to collect my missing mushrooms.\nIf you don't expect too much, you might like it.",
